            "text": "{\"task\":{\"created_at\":\"2026-10-29T08:04:53.462236Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-29T08:04:53.462236Z\",\"org_id\":\"01a186ae-aee2-701c-ac22-c95bcd02a959\",\"project_id\":\"01a186af-8cb3-73e6-a516-63dabac8340b\",\"id\":\"01a186b0-c254-70ea-af73-81dfa92eec88\",\"title\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in…\",\"display_index\":5,\"status\":\"pending\",\"kind\":\"eval\",\"member_id\":\"01a186ae-aef3-74ef-b66c-2704ee86ce73\",\"automation_id\":null,\"runtime_group_id\":\"01a186af-9c3b-7078-9a49-5b659b8db48d\",\"runtime_id\":\"01a186af-9f46-70ba-aadb-a3c911f01c04\",\"is_archived\":false,\"started_at\":null,\"completed_at\":null,\"last_user_message_at\":\"2026-10-29T08:04:53.463195Z\",\"metadata\":{\"error\":null,\"suite\":\"walk\",\"commands\":true,\"agent_name\":\"scripted\",\"task_prompt\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in the shell and reply in one short sentence.\\n\\n<<SCRIPT {\\\"reply\\\":\\\"Echoed the message through hello-mcp and wrote it to the outputs file.\\\",\\\"tools\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"hello-mcp_echo\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"write\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Echo: hello from the public MCP\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"bash\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":{\\\"command\\\":\\\"echo $WALK_MARKER\\\"}}]}>>\",\"active_run_id\":\"01a186b0-c254-70ea-af73-81de505685fa\",\"latest_run_id\":\"01a186b0-c254-70ea-af73-81de505685fa\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall\":null,\"conversation_id